   "fix": "Delete both declarations. Use `(skewAdjointEquivSelfAdjoint (Units.mk0 (-I) (neg_ne_zero.2 I_ne_zero)) h).symm.toContinuousLinearEquiv`, with `h` from `neg_mem Complex.val_mk0_I_mem_skewAdjoint` or `Complex.I_mem_skewAdjoint`; its symm is `H \u21a6 I \u2022 H`. Alternatively use `t = Units.mk0 I I_ne_zero`, whose symm is `H \u21a6 -I \u2022 H`, which gives the same image measure because `hermitianLebesgue` is neg-invariant. Use this equivalence in `skewHermitianLebesgue`, its Haar instance and `lintegral_skewHermitianLebesgue`, and simplify with `coe_skewAdjointEquivSelfAdjoint_symm_apply`.",
